# tools/cp/hunt/settings.p9 -- H1-hunt matrix item 6b (docs/cp-hunt.md): main
# menu -> SETTINGS (the first Down shows the hidden focus on SETTINGS in every
# 720p boot so far: inputcheck.py), then interactive (`ctl`): the graphics
# change and apply are driven from ssh by appending boot_p9 lines to
# OUT/ctl.txt, reading each `shot`'s OCR in the run log.  In-game menus only;
# no first-run screen is ever answered (boot_p9 stops on one).
phase menu
shot menu
key down
wait 1
seek settings-focus main down 4 SETTINGS
key ret
wait 4
phase settings
shot settings
ctl
